    "paragraph": "Conditional Diffusion-based Parameter Generation (CDPG) introduces a framework to generate node-specific predictor parameters for data-scarce target cities rather than aligning raw data from source cities. Another study evaluated an open five-component walkability index across 4,994 census units in Greater London alongside primary-care records for eight cardiometabolic conditions. Finally, qualitative vignettes of six diverse cultural institutions are used to examine major cultural spaces through the lens of Foucault's heterotopia framework.",
